<h2>1. Comparison</h2>
<p><span>Comparison charts are usually the first choice for data visualizat=
ion. This is because in most cases we visualize data to compare. Comparison=
 charts are designed to show how values compare to each other. In most of t=
he cases a </span><strong><span>bar chart</span></strong><span> is the firs=
t and most logical choice.</span></p>
