<a id=3D"part-to-whole-charts" data-hs-anchor=3D"true"></a>
<h2>3. Part-to-whole &amp; hierarchical</h2>
<p><span>Part-to-whole graphs </span><span>is used</span><span> to represen=
t how individual pieces contribute to a complete picture</span><span data-o=
ffset-key=3D"dth53-3-0">. They focus on composition and proportions. </span=
><span style=3D"font-weight: bold;">Stacked bar chart</span><span data-offs=
et-key=3D"dth53-3-2">&nbsp;in majority of the cases tend to be the best opt=
ion amount part-to-whole graphs.</span></p>
