ed convex treemap, see our <a href=3D"https://www.datylon.com/blog/treemap-=
chart-deep-dive">treemap deep=E2=80=91dive article</a><span style=3D"color:=
 #000000;">.</span></span><br><br><a href=3D"https://www.datylon.com/blog/t=
