 it better, we recommend <a href=3D"https://creately.com/blog/diagrams/venn=
-diagrams-vs-euler-diagrams/">this article that explains the difference bet=
ween the Venn and Euler diagram</a><span style=3D"color: #000000;">.<br><br=
></span></span><a href=3D"https://www.datylon.com/blog/types-of-charts-grap=
hs-examples-data-visualization#table-of-contents" rel=3D"noopener"><span st=
yle=3D"font-size: 14px;">Back to table of contents =E2=AC=86=EF=B8=8F</span=
></a></p>
