<h2>4. Data over time (temporal)</h2>
<p><span>Date-over-time graphs are used to visualize trends and changes in =
data over a specific period. The X axis usually represents time, the Y axis=
 the value shows the tracked data. Most common and useful time series chart=
 type is&nbsp;</span><strong>line chart</strong><span>.</span></p>
